    "ssil": "Separated old/new CE and taskwise old KL, with64 additional old replay rows per base batch. Original LwF/RCL/DER++ auxiliary losses retained as an explicit stacked adaptation. Single-class task softmax CE/KL is identically zero. Additional replay exposure recorded.",
